<title>CHINA: Salomon names Asia financial institutions director.</title>
<headline>Salomon names Asia financial institutions director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Asia Pacific said on Tuesday it had named Wing Fai Ng as director of financial institutions, Asia Pacific investment banking, effective August.</p>
<p>Prior to the appointment, Ng was part of SBC Warburg's global financial institutions group, the investment bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
